### Status: Handled
### This operations if not handled may generates as result ghost money
### for example, from PYG 150 to an USD account results in 150 MAGIC USD
POST {{CoreBankingWebApplication_HostAddress}}/api/BalanceTransaction
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "SenderBankAccountId": 3,
    "ReceiverBankAccountId": 4,
    "Amount": 500
}
